%% Last updated: 2026-03-28
sequenceDiagram
    title: Process B2 - Detailed Maintenance Runtime
    autonumber
    box Device Agent
        participant Agent as Agent v2
        participant Uploader as Upload Worker
        participant LocalTSDB as Local TSDB
        participant RunStore as Local Run Store
    end
    box Backend Services
        participant Fleet as Fleet Manager
        participant ELab as eLabFTW
        participant Mimir as Mimir
    end
    Note over Agent,Mimir: Derived from sequence-lifecycle-v2-normalized.mmd
    
    rect rgb(255,243,224)
        Note over Agent,Mimir: MAINTENANCE
        Agent->>Uploader: Check maintenance window + slot/jitter
        Agent-)Uploader: Set cron wake-up to re-check<br/>maintenance window + slot/jitter

        loop while window+slot is open
            Uploader->>RunStore: Read staged upload params
            Uploader->>RunStore: Check pending upload queues
            Uploader->>Uploader: Drain queued uploads<br/>using staged upload params
            alt no pending upload data
                Uploader->>Uploader: No pending upload data,<br/>skip this maintenance tick
            else pending upload data
                alt pending metrics/logs
                    Uploader->>LocalTSDB: Read pending metrics/logs batch
                    Uploader->>Mimir: Upload pending metrics + logs
                    Mimir-->>Uploader: metrics/logs ACK/err
                    Uploader->>Fleet: gRPC ReportUploadStatus(metrics/logs ACK/err)
                    Fleet->>ELab: PATCH /event/{run_event_id} metadata:<br/>metrics/logs upload state
                else no pending metrics/logs
                    Uploader->>Uploader: Skip metrics/logs upload
                end
                alt pending artifacts
                    Uploader->>RunStore: Read next artifact bytes + metadata
                    Uploader->>Fleet: gRPC UploadArtifact(stream header + chunks)
                    Fleet->>Fleet: Stage artifact in server spool
                    alt artifact is run-summary.json
                        Fleet->>Fleet: Build wireless-run-evidence-bundle.tar.gz
                        Fleet->>ELab: POST /experiments/{id}/uploads<br/>bundle + run-summary.json
                        Fleet-->>Uploader: gRPC UploadArtifactResponse(ACCEPTED,<br/>server_finalized=true)
                    else normal artifact
                        Fleet-->>Uploader: gRPC UploadArtifactResponse(ACCEPTED,<br/>server_finalized=false)
                    end
                    opt upload status events enabled
                        Uploader->>Fleet: gRPC ReportArtifactUploadStatus(ACK/err)
                        Fleet->>ELab: PATCH /event/{run_event_id} metadata:<br/>artifacts state + last uploaded ptr
                    end
                else no pending artifacts
                    Uploader->>Uploader: Skip artifacts upload
                end
                Uploader->>Fleet: gRPC PublishReport(report with run_id)
                Fleet->>Fleet: Map upload/report status
                Fleet->>ELab: PATCH /items/{id} metadata:<br/>last report upload state + run_id
                Fleet-->>Uploader: gRPC PublishReportResponse(ACK/err)
                alt report upload ACK
                    Uploader->>RunStore: Mark run local state = sent
                else report upload err
                    Uploader->>RunStore: Keep run pending for next maintenance tick
                end
            end
            Uploader->>Uploader: Check maintenance window + slot/jitter
        end
    end

    Note over Agent,Mimir: No data-loss path.<br/>Unsent runs stay local until a later maintenance window
